  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#autofilling-form-controls:-the-autocomplete-attribute\r\n\r\n> \"sex\"\tGender identity \\(e\\.g\\. Female, Fa'afafine\\)\r\n\r\nThe field name **sex** shows meaning as **Gender** identity. But in reality they are different\r\n\r\n**Sex:**\r\nSex can be one of the following\r\n- Male\r\n- Female\r\n- Unknown\r\n\r\n**Gender:**\r\nSex can be one of the following\r\n\r\n- Female\r\n- Male\r\n- Neither exclusively male or female\r\n- Other\r\n- Transgender Female\r\n- Transgender Male\r\n- Unknown\r\n",
